# Codex CLI auto-generated companion (equivalent to CLAUDE.md, per-user)
AGENTS.md

# Runtime-materialized skill scaffolds. The tracked .agents/skills/<name>/
# directories (bun, find-skills, mcp-builder, plugin-creator,
# plugin-settings, plugin-structure) are intentional reference content.
# These four `openspec-*` and four `source-command-opsx-*` directories
# are written by the Claude Code runtime when /opsx:* skills are invoked
# — they're regenerated per-session and would otherwise produce noise
# diffs every time a contributor uses the opsx workflow.
.agents/skills/openspec-apply-change/
.agents/skills/openspec-archive-change/
.agents/skills/openspec-explore/
.agents/skills/openspec-propose/
.agents/skills/source-command-opsx-apply/
.agents/skills/source-command-opsx-archive/
.agents/skills/source-command-opsx-explore/
.agents/skills/source-command-opsx-propose/
